        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AZ overslept all the way until homeroom was over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I really need to go home...&quot; <br>But something is wrong—the schoolyard has changed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the darkness, strange and unknown creatures begin to appear.<br>Now, survival is the only goal. And there's only one way: turn the familiar into weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ <strong>Unique Combat with School Supplies</strong><br>Fight using pencils, rulers, scissors, and more!<br>Stab with pencils, slash with rulers, spin-cut with scissors—<br>ordinary supplies become powerful weapons in satisfying combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ <strong>One Character, Infinite Growth</strong><br>Only one character, but endless possibilities!<br>A random mission system unlocks dozens of combat styles.<br>Each run is new. Each run, you grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ <strong>Pixel Graphics &amp; Nostalgic Vibes</strong><br>Relive school days with cute pixel art and analog charm.<br>A simple, cozy feeling set in a familiar schoolyard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ <strong>The More You Play, The Stronger You Get</strong><br>Unlock permanent upgrades through repeated play.<br>Survive longer and dive deeper in a meta-loop of endless growth!</p>",
